Source rights for Hamburg official legislation

German statutes and regulations are official works under section 5(1) of the German Copyright Act (Urheberrechtsgesetz) and are not protected by copyright. The legal wording in this edition is copied from the official Landesrecht Hamburg consolidated source. Source attribution is recorded in NOTICE.md and each act's metadata.

The inspected Hamburg gazette dataset names Datenlizenz Deutschland – Namensnennung – Version 2.0 (dl-de-by-2.0), https://www.govdata.de/dl-de/by-2-0. Its attribution is retained for the earlier dataset inventory. No gazette text or PDF is included in this edition.

This statement concerns the official texts and identified source metadata. Rights to unrelated portal content remain with their respective holders.
